      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p class="article-subtitle">
        Human approval is only strong authorization evidence when the enterprise can show what was presented, what the approval was bound to, and whether that same effect executed.
      </p>
      <p class="article-meta">By BeaconGuard · November 18, 2026</p>
      <figure class="article-featured">
        <img
          src={featuredImage}
